this Advantage allows a character to get a head start (or a
handicap) in these pursuits.
See Caerns on pp. 190–195 for more information,
• Caern Access: You are allowed to make use of a
specific Caern belonging to another sept, as long
as your actions do not interfere with their activities
or jeopardizes the safety of the caern. You should
agree on the nature of the caern and the warding
sept with the Storyteller.
••••• Awakened Caern: You are part of a sept warding
a caern that has already been awakened to some
degree, or you are on the verge of discovering a
caern of significance, already half-awakened. Add
one to the caern value of the first caern you join or
