in their areas of expertise, and they may want
to exchange favors of various kinds. For different kinds of
help, call on your Allies (p. 101) or Mentor (p. 104).
A Contact is someone in an excellent position to get
information. They might be a police dispatcher, rather
than a homicide lieutenant, or a congressional staffer,
rather than a senator. Information brokers, reporters,
underworld fixers, and transport drivers make excellent
