Renown
As do many Traits, each Renown score has a ranking of
one to five. Overall, a werewolf’s Renown represents how
well they embody being Garou, from how virtuous other
werewolves perceive them to be to how positively the
animistic spirits of the Umbra regard them.
A Garou’s Renown has a few important functions.
0 For most Gifts, the Renown type associated with that
Gift contributes to the dice pool to use that Gift and
