Also, as long as a character has a Renown type subject to
chagrin, no experience points can be spent to increase it.
Chagrin is a temporary status, and emerging from it
is based on the character’s contrition. In most cases, performing
an act of noteworthy Glory, Honor, or Wisdom
suffices. In particularly egregious cases, a Rite of Contrition
