the Patron Spirits of each tribe; the spirit of wilderness
and predatory birds; Old Man Sea, the spirit of the coast
and seafarers; and the Wyrm-spirit of unnatural rot.
What they might want: A rival’s champion’s dying
breath, a scale stolen from one of the Wyrm’s hellish lairs,
the wind that carries the name of their bygone paramour,
black fire, three feathers
