Scryers
Scryers are gafflings that exist to spy on targets for stronger
spirits that hold the Scryers in thrall; in some cases,
the lesser spirits do so transactionally. They are Banes of
surveillance, suspicion, mistrust, and paranoia.
Possession / Manifestation: Scryers vary widely in spirit
form, but their “eyes” are the most distinctive parts of
their bodies. They sometimes appear as fly-spirits with
oversized eyes, or as vigilant bird-spirits, again with dominant
eyes. Sometimes, a Scryer in its spirit-form is just
a single floating eye. The eyes of physically manifesting
