almost defenseless in this state, but they are often accompanied
by Banes eager to cross the Gauntlet. Wyrmholes
do not pull physical entities into the Umbra (though they
may pull spirits out of their hosts and back into the Umbra,
particularly unwilling ones), but they can serve as
