The pack may come in conflict with multiple (perhaps
even coordinated) Cruel Fomori, or one particularly
significant Cruel Fomor might be the primary antagonist
in the environment. Defeating the fomor probably ends
the possession and sends the Bane back into the Umbra,
to be dealt with in another conflict, or as an extension of
the same conflict.
Example Cruel Fomori:
FACTORY FARM OVERSEER
The Factory Farm Overseer supervises a concentrated
animal feeding operation (CAFO) facility secretly dedicated
to the Fly Mother, an avatar of Fly. It leads a team
of “dedicated facility security operators” (five Grunt
Fomori, p. 263).
