Rampaging Bane
Having been invited by the wretched
individuals they possessed to become Cruel
Fomori, Rampaging Banes represent the
spiritual costs of whatever exploitation
is happening at the operation site. Banes
maliciously embody themselves in any (consciously
or subconsciously) willing host
and sow ruin. They retreat to the Umbra
whenever they exhaust the capacities of
their “meat sacks,” including having them
torn to shreds by werewolves. Once in the
Umbra, the Rampaging Bane is on their
home territory. As above, the pack may
contend with multiple lesser Banes, one
especially potent Bane, or some mix, as befits the severity
of the situation.
