Wayseeker Philodox (Homid Form)
Contemplative, almost serene, the Wayseeker Philodox
brings a rational, considered perspective to a problem
that’s proximate to ones the Garou face, but not quite
the same. There’s a cooperative and even Renown-worthy
solution at hand, but it’s not how the pack would
do things. The Wayseeker Philodox makes a compelling
case, but is it the thing werewolves are best suited to do?
The Wayseeker Philodox may have more faith in the pack
than the Garou have in themselves.
